{"translation-revision-date":"2026-10-31 19:27+0100","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"app\/react\/admin\/redirections\/RedirectionEditor.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"hu_HU","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Redirections":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"SEO":["SEO"],"Redirection type":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s t\u00edpusa"],"Edit redirection":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s szerkeszt\u00e9se"],"Redirection saved.":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s elmentve."],"Origin URL":["Eredeti URL"],"Cancel":["M\u00e9gse"],"301 \u2014 Moved permanently":["301 \u2014 V\u00e9glegesen \u00e1thelyezve"],"302 \u2014 Found (temporary)":["302 \u2014 Megtal\u00e1lva (ideiglenes)"],"307 \u2014 Temporary redirect":["307 \u2014 Ideiglenes \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s"],"410 \u2014 Gone":["410 \u2014 Megsz\u0171nt"],"451 \u2014 Unavailable for legal reasons":["451 \u2014 Jogi okokb\u00f3l nem \u00e9rhet\u0151 el"],"Exactly match all parameters":["Az \u00f6sszes param\u00e9ter pontos egyez\u00e9se"],"Exclude all parameters":["Minden param\u00e9ter kiz\u00e1r\u00e1sa"],"Exclude all parameters and pass them to the redirection":["Minden param\u00e9ter kiz\u00e1r\u00e1sa, \u00e9s azok \u00e1tad\u00e1sa az \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1snak"],"Failed to load redirection.":["Az \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s bet\u00f6lt\u00e9se sikertelen."],"Redirection created.":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s l\u00e9trehozva."],"Save failed.":["A ment\u00e9s sikertelen."],"Add new redirection":["\u00daj \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Enabled":["Bekapcsolva"],"Disabled":["Kikapcsolva"],"Unsaved changes":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"Test URL":["URL tesztel\u00e9se"],"Add another":["\u00dajabb hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Save":["Ment\u00e9s"],"Create redirection":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa"],"Save redirection":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s ment\u00e9se"],"Redirection":["\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s"],"e.g. old-page or category\/old-slug":["pl. regi-oldal vagy kategoria\/regi-slug"],"Enter a regex pattern. It is stored exactly as typed and matched against the full path, leading slash included.":["Adjon meg egy regul\u00e1ris kifejez\u00e9sk\u00e9nt haszn\u00e1lt blokkmint\u00e1t. A rendszer pontosan \u00fagy t\u00e1rolja, ahogyan megadta, \u00e9s a teljes el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fattal egyezteti, a kezd\u0151 perjellel egy\u00fctt."],"Enter a relative path (without domain, no anchor).":["Adjon meg egy relat\u00edv el\u00e9r\u00e9si utat (domain \u00e9s horgony n\u00e9lk\u00fcl)."],"Enable regex matching":["Regex-egyeztet\u00e9s bekapcsol\u00e1sa"],"When enabled, the Origin URL is treated as a regex pattern. Use $1, $2\u2026 for capture groups in the destination.":["Bekapcsolt \u00e1llapotban a forr\u00e1s-URL-t a rendszer regul\u00e1ris kifejez\u00e9sk\u00e9nt kezeli. A c\u00e9lban a $1, $2\u2026 jel\u00f6l\u00e9sekkel hivatkozhat a r\u00f6gz\u00edtett csoportokra."],"This pattern is not anchored, so it matches anywhere in the path, not just at the start. For example \"it\" also matches \/credit and \/kits. Start it with \"\/\" or \"^\/\" to only match the beginning of the URL.":["Ez a blokkminta nincs horgonyhoz k\u00f6tve, ez\u00e9rt az el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fat b\u00e1rmely r\u00e9sz\u00e9n egyez\u00e9st tal\u00e1l, nem csak az elej\u00e9n. P\u00e9ld\u00e1ul az \u201eit\u201d a \/credit \u00e9s a \/kits \u00fatvonalban is egyez\u00e9st tal\u00e1l. Kezdje \u201e\/\u201d vagy \u201e^\/\u201d jellel, ha csak az URL elej\u00e9n szeretne egyez\u00e9st tal\u00e1lni."],"Advanced options":["Halad\u00f3 opci\u00f3k"],"Query parameter handling":["Lek\u00e9rdez\u00e9si param\u00e9terek kezel\u00e9se"],"Apply to":["Alkalmaz\u00e1s erre"],"Discard changes":["M\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sok elvet\u00e9se"],"You have unsaved changes. Are you sure you want to leave?":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak. Biztosan el akarja hagyni az oldalt?"]}}}